// 60 FPS method from the FPSLocker patch for this build
// (https://github.com/masagrator/FPSLocker-Warehouse). Its runtime writes to
// the swap interval globals and the layer manager step are replaced by the
// static sources of those values. Its dynamic resolution budget hook is
// omitted: at 60 FPS it returns 1/60, identical to the stock refresh period
// getter it replaces. Byte-verified against the IDB.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
